  "note_on_matching_methodology": "size_bin_recall_delta comes from this project's own greedy IoU matcher (training/detection/ground_pv/condition_error_analysis.py), run independently against BOTH checkpoints at each checkpoint's OWN training imgsz, at a fixed conf>=0.20/IoU>=0.5 matching threshold \u2014 the same methodology Phase 15C used for v3. This is why matching-based overall recall can differ from the official Ultralytics test recall (which reports each class's best-F1 point on the full PR curve, not a literal count at conf=0.20) \u2014 both are reported, never conflated."
